{"full":"hf:lvwerra/cowrite","spaceId":"lvwerra/cowrite","name":"cowrite","source":"huggingface","description":"An interactive AI application on Hugging Face Spaces.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":null,"topics":["docker","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":5,"created":"2026-07-16T21:18:51.000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T13:54:52.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://lvwerra-cowrite.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/lvwerra/cowrite","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:29:40.602Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T22:29:40.602Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T22:29:40.602Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"✍️","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A real-time collaborative document editor (Google-Docs-lite) where AI agents are collaborators that never write directly — they only:","Agents are invoked from comments: mention @your-agent do something and the task is delivered to the agent the next time it polls. The comment shows a live status chip: ⏳ pending → 👀 seen → ✅ handled (or ⚠️ failed). Each user brings their own agent (Claude Code, Codex, …) — the UI has a \"copy agent prompt\" button that turns any coding agent into a polling collaborator. Signed-in users also get a private built-in OpenCode worker powered by moonshotai/Kimi-K3 through Hugging Face Inference Providers. Its only enabled network tool is web search; Cowrite validates and applies its structured…","The agent prompt is explicit about where an agent's output goes: the document is the deliverable, so anything worth reading later is proposed as a suggestion or a new page, and thread replies stay one or two sentences (\"what I did, where to look\"). Overlong comments are collapsed behind a \"Show more\" in the UI."],"features":["comment in anchored threads, and","propose suggestions (block replacements) that a human accepts or rejects."],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/lvwerra/cowrite/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"05ce5f5ce309d03969e9ba0f9b2c4a638ce07a633502a093982e94788fffb6e8","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T22:29:40.657Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:29:40.657Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A real-time collaborative document editor (Google-Docs-lite) where AI agents are collaborators that never write directly — they only:","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/lvwerra/cowrite/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"05ce5f5ce309d03969e9ba0f9b2c4a638ce07a633502a093982e94788fffb6e8","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/lvwerra/cowrite/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T22:29:40.657Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T13:54:52.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/lvwerra/cowrite/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T22:29:40.657Z","hash":"05ce5f5ce309d03969e9ba0f9b2c4a638ce07a633502a093982e94788fffb6e8","originalBytes":4748,"storedBytes":4748,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["agent","suggestions","agents","comments","docs","oauth","comment","page","post","threads","anchored","mentions","npm","only","user","api","block","cowrite","data","document","get","markdown","same","search","server","task","them","thread","where","yjs","account","auth","behind","built-in","cannot","code","delivery","dev","dir","each","editor","edits","every","failed","handle","handles","http","human","inference","itself.","lines","live","long-poll","one","opencode","over","pages","pending","prompt","propose","reorganize","reply","server-mediated","sidebar","standalone","storage","structure","suggestion","test","their","they","token","tree","web","y.doc","yaml","about","accept","accepts","ack","act","agent-created","agent.","allowed.","always","any","anything","app","app-data","applies","arbitrary","architecture","attach","authenticate","authorization","bar","bash","bearer","bearer-token","before","binary","blocks","bottom","bound","brings","brows